  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Dolca Slim is prebiotic cane sugar, natural fiber combined with real cane sugar. It's a one-for-one swap for regular sugar that adds daily gut support to what people already do: sweeten their coffee. No new habits, no pills, no powders. Just better sugar.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Most gut health products ask people to add something new. Dolca replaces something they're already using. It tastes like real sugar because it is real sugar—just with fiber built in. No artificial sweeteners, no weird aftertaste, no behavior change required.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">15% commission on every sale you refer. 30-day cookie window—if someone clicks your link and buys within 30 days, you get credit.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Show your morning routine. Stir it into your coffee. Talk about how you're getting fiber without thinking about it. The hook is simplicity, \"I switched my sugar and now I'm getting daily fiber.\" Works for coffee content, wellness content, mom content, \"small swaps\" content, anti-artificial-sweetener content, baking content.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
